  desc:"Equal vinegar and water, sugar and salt, poured hot over anything in a jar. Ready in an hour.",
  dek:"One brine ratio does every vegetable: equal parts vinegar and water, two tablespoons each of sugar and salt per cup of liquid. Pour it hot for pickles ready in an hour and softer in texture, or cold for something that takes a day and stays properly crunchy.",
  card:"1 cup vinegar : 1 cup water : 2 tbsp sugar : 2 tbsp salt. Pour hot for fast, cold for crunchy.",
